        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC44-HLD, Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Holden Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned for easy installation, the Marcel Entry Door Handleset with the Holden Lever is a direct replacement for most modern front door handlesets. It will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The Marcel Entry Set with Holden Lever is a transitional front door lock that is perfect for modernising your home. The clean lines of the square escutcheon plates add curb appeal to your home; and the Holden Lever interior trim will add a fresh look inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Marcel Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Clearance: 1-3/4</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC44-HLD-specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC44-HLD Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
