                "description": "Designed for easy installation, the Marcel Entry Door Handleset with the Holden Lever is a direct replacement for most modern front door handlesets. It will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The Marcel Entry Set with Holden Lever is a transitional front door lock that is perfect for modernising your home. The clean lines of the square escutcheon plates add curb appeal to your home; and the Holden Lever interior trim will add a fresh look inside.",
